{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261019/photo/bkn-20261019174548385-1019_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261019185239\"/><p>今日(19日)下午3時39分，大埔社山村一名村屋男住戶報案，指其愛貓懷疑被鄰居的飼養的8隻狗咬死。警員到場了解，並且尋獲一具貓咪屍體，身上疑有咬痕。案件列作「狗咬」跟進，飼主表明會自行向鄰居追究責任，毋須協助。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T10:59:05.653086+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:45:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T11:17:40.027010+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:56:57.562453+00:00","content_hash":"2700ceb26c8baf30ac6309eac68883a14ca9b58d8eaaba89d8fcccd658700307","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}